window.THREADS["177853"] = {"tid": "177853", "title": "讨论下关于老的片子是否有收集价值", "category": "交流", "typeid": "7", "author": "17tree", "uid": "363787", "date": "2026-10-24 14:24:32", "views": 3011, "replies": 11, "pages_fetched": 1, "post_count": 12, "cover": "", "all_images": [], "pan": [], "pan_floor": [], "article": {"author": "17tree", "uid": "363787", "avatar": "", "date": "2026-10-24 14:24:32", "html": "贴一个之前的种子。原档无水印 vrtm-177-200<br />\nmagnet:?xt=urn:btih:59ff9271f6532748bb59daf704022aa0c1529555<br />\n然后就是最近115封号严重，很多原档无水印的，不知道该咋办了，硬盘太贵了，买不起。是直接做种再存，还是咋弄。", "images": []}, "comments": [{"floor": 2, "author": "橘子坏了", "uid": "576274", "avatar": "", "date": "2026-10-24 15:27:04", "html": "vrtm还有zmen、spcx、scop、hunt，rct，oyc等等好多老片子我都有收藏，这几天很多大佬分享的破解资源弄的我开始清理硬盘了，这些高清占空间，给清理了都，lz的资源蛮牛逼，高清无水印", "images": []}, {"floor": 3, "author": "liangbbbba", "uid": "365417", "avatar": "", "date": "2026-10-24 15:33:55", "html": "去买二手sas接口的硬盘，比较便宜", "images": []}, {"floor": 4, "author": "Mr.Bad", "uid": "411888", "avatar": "", "date": "2026-10-24 16:53:56", "html": "<div class=\"quote\"><blockquote><font size=\"2\"><a href=\"https://www.javbus.com/forum/forum.php?mod=redirect&amp;goto=findpost&amp;pid=4967492&amp;ptid=177853\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#999999\">liangbbbba 發表於 2026-10-24 15:33</font></a></font><br />\n去买二手sas接口的硬盘，比较便宜</blockquote></div><br />\n买了sas盘之后是买老款服务器准系统、买cpu、买ddr3内存，然后再继续买硬盘，直到塞满服务器的硬盘位……", "images": []}, {"floor": 5, "author": "17tree", "uid": "363787", "avatar": "", "date": "2026-10-24 17:30:02", "html": "<div class=\"quote\"><blockquote><font size=\"2\"><a href=\"https://www.javbus.com/forum/forum.php?mod=redirect&amp;goto=findpost&amp;pid=4967573&amp;ptid=177853\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#999999\">Mr.Bad 發表於 2026-10-24 16:53</font></a></font><br />\n买了sas盘之后是买老款服务器准系统、买cpu、买ddr3内存，然后再继续买硬盘，直到塞满服务器的硬盘位…… ...</blockquote></div><br />\n感觉不值当啊，还是做种分享吧", "images": []}, {"floor": 6, "author": "big超", "uid": "351035", "avatar": "", "date": "2026-10-24 18:22:19", "html": "不要瞎搞 硬盘 水可深了 我买了俩次 都让我测试出问题了&nbsp;&nbsp;卖家那边对峙不过 直接给我退货退款了 我现在 也不够用&nbsp;&nbsp;也不折腾了&nbsp;&nbsp;假货 瑕疵品&nbsp;&nbsp;以次充好的太多了", "images": []}, {"floor": 7, "author": "zz5201314bb", "uid": "124915", "avatar": "", "date": "2026-10-25 06:51:44", "html": "买空间扩容卡？", "images": []}, {"floor": 8, "author": "实验小将", "uid": "382505", "avatar": "", "date": "2026-10-25 11:31:54", "html": "其实也是个戒掉仓鼠症的机会，毕竟很多片子真的只是收集来，也不看，白白占用储存，不如做种以后想看再下", "images": []}, {"floor": 9, "author": "17tree", "uid": "363787", "avatar": "", "date": "2026-10-25 11:55:36", "html": "<div class=\"quote\"><blockquote><font size=\"2\"><a href=\"https://www.javbus.com/forum/forum.php?mod=redirect&amp;goto=findpost&amp;pid=4968636&amp;ptid=177853\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#999999\">实验小将 發表於 2026-10-25 11:31</font></a></font><br />\n其实也是个戒掉仓鼠症的机会，毕竟很多片子真的只是收集来，也不看，白白占用储存，不如做种以后想看再下 ...</blockquote></div><br />\n关键是，无水印源档，还不能秒传的那种", "images": []}, {"floor": 10, "author": "tjxjs1", "uid": "90507", "avatar": "", "date": "2026-10-25 17:33:16", "html": "主要是看有没有变现的价值", "images": []}, {"floor": 11, "author": "17tree", "uid": "363787", "avatar": "", "date": "2026-10-25 21:42:36", "html": "<div class=\"quote\"><blockquote><font size=\"2\"><a href=\"https://www.javbus.com/forum/forum.php?mod=redirect&amp;goto=findpost&amp;pid=4967484&amp;ptid=177853\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#999999\">橘子坏了 發表於 2026-10-24 15:27</font></a></font><br />\nvrtm还有zmen、spcx、scop、hunt，rct，oyc等等好多老片子我都有收藏，这几天很多大佬分享的破解资源弄的我 ...</blockquote></div><br />\n必须啊，也是搬运来的，只是没地方存了，太可惜了。", "images": []}, {"floor": 12, "author": "demoncry001", "uid": "298985", "avatar": "", "date": "2026-10-26 14:14:26", "html": "当然有，比如当年水岛的", "images": []}]};
